%% Figure 6 — Bridge Daemon State Machine
%% See src/bridge/bridge_daemon.py. Each tick (125 Hz) drives the transitions.

stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> INIT
    INIT: INIT\nload profiles\nload config
    CONNECTING: CONNECTING\nRTDE handshake (port 30004)\nKlippy socket open
    RUNNING: RUNNING\nread regs → plan → G-code\nwrite status\n(125 Hz loop)
    FAULT: FAULT\ndisable stepper\nwrite fault=1\nraise error_code
    RECONNECTING: RECONNECTING\nexponential backoff\n(2 s … 30 s)

    INIT --> CONNECTING : deps ready
    CONNECTING --> RUNNING : both links up
    CONNECTING --> FAULT : auth / config error
    RUNNING --> FAULT : e-stop bit set\nstall detected\nthermal warning
    RUNNING --> RECONNECTING : watchdog 500 ms\nklippy disconnect
    RECONNECTING --> CONNECTING : retry
    FAULT --> RECONNECTING : operator clears\nfault bit
    FAULT --> [*] : SIGTERM
    RUNNING --> [*] : SIGTERM
